SUMMARY:FYI: Supersonic | Percussion
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**Supersonic \\| Percussion**\nJuly 26 @ 7:
 30 pm - 9:00 pm - Free\nExperience the pulse-pounding excitement of Brevar
 d Music Center’s Percussion Studio!\nStudents and faculty deliver an ele
 ctrifying showcase of rhythm and precision with dazzling drumming\, syncop
 ated grooves\, and boundless energy. This high-impact performance promises
  fun for the whole family.\n**Venue**\nBrevard Music Center\, Whittington-
 Pfohl Auditorium\n349 Andante Lane\nBrevard\, NC\nhttps://visithendersonvi
 llenc.org/event/supersonic-percussion\nhttps://www.brevardmusic.org/event/
 supersonic-percussion-2/
